  "known_limitations": [
    "A decoded-frame-0 lineage audit found exactly 120 frozen VerseCrafter TI2V30 rows (15 families x 4 tiers x LR/RL at 30 degrees) with an incorrect first frame. Original bytes and scores remain historical frozen provenance; replacement assets and new scores belong only to the separately tagged rolling release.",
